Update the implementation of Attribute.getValidKey to delegate coercion/validation to AttributeKeyUtil. The method signature remains unchanged (preserves public API). New body example:

public static String getValidKey(String key, Syntax syntax) {
    if (syntax == Syntax.xml && !AttributeKeyUtil.isValidXmlKey(key)) {
        return AttributeKeyUtil.coerceXmlKey(key);
    } else if (syntax == Syntax.html && !AttributeKeyUtil.isValidHtmlKey(key)) {
        return AttributeKeyUtil.coerceHtmlKey(key);
    }
    return key;
}

This keeps behavior equivalent while removing implementation detail from Attribute.
